<title>THAILAND: American Standard '96 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>American Standard '96 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for American Standard for 1996 ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		45.24		     45.60</p>
<p>    Net			339.30		    342.03</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is American Standard Plc, a sanitaryware producer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
